ent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307444_1071721787948215_7381303741412865625_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kZikina1uXMQ7kNvwFq8ERO&_nc_oc=AdqolpEXqLae3H2qvH4BIUCy9dVUQH3Y-HLn2YY4ZSo2kqHVcqpHXVKcZMfuv2Ekl7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRQHPgFpWQDM1U4X0ajRl5WNqBP7WBsVXq2saUj9-nRLA&oe=6B06FA53"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Gloves up_Landscape Game Cover.png", "id": "1104717774910712", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619829_1104717781577378_8494564826830694206_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RQHXkXpZt9sQ7kNvwFEtBRR&_nc_oc=Adonr5PSLO-ggYQpkr8jB9HXAP0mfF-ETAzv0hXl94xFUEG80CgfBA__0ZY45_Y0Oxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQLPVMplgxZufGmqnGgvzY6TOvHqW4PXBCPKWhgeeY7Yw&oe=6B070DC5"}, "display_name": "Gloves Up", "keywords": ["Fighting", "Simulation", "SinglePlayer", "Fitness", "Training"], "long_description": "**Gloves Up** is a single-player VR boxing sandbox where every punch reshapes the sport.\n- Difficulty and power settings let you control the action - drawn-out tactical bouts to heavy-hitting combos that drop fighters instantly\n- Scalable crowd simulation supports over 1,000 spectators\n- Career progression driven by stats, aging, and performance \u2014 grow, peak, and fade across your legacy\n- Procedural fighter generation ensures unique rosters and endless replayability\n- 50 years of simulated fight history creates a living world before you ever lace up\n- Dynamic roster mechanics rotate hundreds of fighters through Amateurs and Professional divisions\n- Unlimited career path: fight 400+ amateur bouts or skip the spotlight entirely - it's your legacy\n\n# Early Access Notice\nCore systems are live. Your feedback will shape the future of the fight", "short_description": "Your fight. Your legacy. Gloves Up is a full-scale VR boxi